# ============================================================
# GPPS -- Which countries have RSM linkage, and what % of each
# country's policies carry it
#
# RSM is detected two independent ways:
#   A. Structured : objRel entries with plcyObjTypeCde == 'REG'
#   B. Anywhere   : any string value in the policy JSON matching
#                   RSM-<digits> (catches RSM ids sitting in fields
#                   we haven't specifically looked at)
#
# A policy counts as "with RSM" if EITHER method finds something.
# Both are shown separately so you can see whether B finds more
# than A (i.e. RSM ids outside the known objRel path).
#
# Tables are discovered dynamically; tables that can't be read are
# shown as NO ACCESS / EMPTY rather than as 0%, so an unreadable
# country is never mistaken for "no RSM".
# ============================================================

